ashians, including the infamous <a href=\"#/wiki/Koshei%20the%20Deathless\">Koshei the Deathless</a>, could take a bath. The 3 door entrance has notably enabled one player to teleport another to their hometown, easier than traditional 2-player teleporting at a depot Locker.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Darashia_Street_Buildings\">Related Darashia Street Buildings</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Darashia Market</li><li>Darashia Palace</li><li>Darashia, Eastern Guildhall</li><li>Darashia, Western Guildhall</li><li>Muhaydin</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["koshei-the-deathless-quest"]}